\0
The planet Gunawan was the site of the largest single battle in the conflict. The planet's supply lines were severed, and the Freedom Guard stronghold in the capitol of Indra was besieged by a massive Imperium contingent. Indra's last line of defense was a canyon pass just outside the city. 
\1
The siege of Indra is nearing its conclusion. Commander Radec and several other ranking members of the Synod are preparing to depart the planet before the installation falls. With these men dead, the enemy's resolve will be broken. We will not allow them to escape. Assault the pass outside the Freedom Guard stronghold and eliminate all Headquarters there. Break the pass before the Freedom Guard's leaders can escape the planet.
\n\n
\cOBJECTIVES\n
\n
-->  Assault the Freedom Guard base and\n
\s\s\s\s destroy all HQs before their commanders\n
\s\s\s\s can escape the planet
\2
Good enough. Proceed.\n
\n
\cHISTORICAL OUTCOME:\n
An enormous Imperium invasion force besieged the city of Indra for several weeks. Tens of thousands were killed on both sides. The Imperium poured endless waves of armor into the city until some avenues of approach become blocked by walls of the broken machines. The Imperium, however, had severed Freedom Guard supply lines, and eventually they overwhelmed the city. Several key Freedom Guard commanders, including Jeb Radec and Gerhad Bantrill, escaped the city before it collapsed and attempted to regroup their scattered forces on Elmaean. Among those in their company was Imperium mole Stiv Baator.
\3
Go back and try again. Failure is not acceptable
